  "id": "n83-334116fe3a2b3986b85b",
  "notes": "Found on 2026-11-22 by a sampling search over the cyclic group Z_83. The skew first block is the Paley block, fixed in advance and invariant under the squares mod 83; rows of the other three blocks whose periodic autocorrelations lie in fixed windows form pools, and the pools are joined exactly. This is a sample and not a census. The Goethals-Seidel matrix of these rows is a skew-Hadamard matrix of order 332. Skew-Hadamard matrices of that order were already known and the board already holds a quadruple with a skew block at n=83 from a published family; in this quadruple the blocks B, C and D have no symmetry."
